  "details": "After this IK 2.0 update it refuses to let me use my Vive wands as trackers, I have always used that without problems before the update\nWhy can the game let controllers be used as trackers before and now suddenly it can't? You guys said that you don't support it when it clearly does before. Many people have paid for VRC+ to support you guys, and now we're shut out of the game.\nIts extremely hard for people outside of the States and EU to get Vive trackers without it being overpriced or just straight up unavailable at all. I love and support this game and I really want to play it to the fullest, please consider fixing this somehow.",
